  "body": "Some homes just have that special something - and tucked away at the end of a private driveway, this beautifully renovated Northcross retreat is one of them.\r\n\r\nElevated to capture all-day sunshine, with beautiful ocean views stretching towards Rangitoto, this is a home where you can enjoy a little more peace, a little more privacy, and a relaxed lifestyle surrounded by nature.\r\n\r\nMature trees frame the setting, creating a lovely sense of seclusion from the moment you arrive. Two decks offer wonderful places to enjoy your morning coffee, entertain family and friends, or simply sit back, listen to the birds, and soak up the leafy outlook.\r\n\r\nInside, the home feels warm, welcoming, and wonderfully liveable. The upper level brings together the master bedroom, two bathrooms, kitchen, dining area, conservatory, and a comfortable lounge, with the living and dining spaces opening onto a covered deck. It's an easy, natural flow that makes the most of the sunshine and extends your living space outdoors throughout the year.\r\n\r\nWhen winter arrives, the fireplace sets the scene for cosy evenings at home, while the HRV system and heat pump help keep things comfortable in every season.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, two further bedrooms provide plenty of options for family, visitors, or a work-from-home setup. One particularly spacious bedroom opens straight onto the lower deck, where the garden beyond offers a private, green backdrop and plenty of room for children to play, enjoy the trampoline, or kick a ball around.\r\n\r\nNeed a little extra space of your own? The separate studio cabin could be your home office, creative hideaway, she shed, man cave, or the perfect spot to pursue a favourite hobby.\r\n\r\nPracticality hasn't been overlooked either. The extensive under-house storage offers an impressive amount of room for everything from tools and sporting equipment to outdoor gear and seasonal belongings. Add a double carport, and you have a property that works just as well for everyday life as it does for relaxed weekends.\r\n\r\nThe location is another real plus. Set in popular Northcross, you're close to beaches, local bus stops, and scenic walking tracks, with Westfield Albany, the Albany Busway, and motorway connections conveniently nearby. School zoning includes Sherwood School, Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a home with sunshine, space, privacy, and room for everyone to enjoy their own corner, this could be just the one. A peaceful retreat with the convenience of North Shore living close at hand, it's ready for its next chapter - and for new owners to make it their own.\r\n\r\nContact Fleur today for more information.\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale: Thursday 19 November at 2pm (unless sold prior).",
